Enable PAN on this port: user memory access has been broken without it.

user_access_enable() clears PAN only when __ARM_PAN_AVAILABLE__ is defined,
and that macro is set by Apple's own SoC headers alone. Here the function
compiled to nothing, so the copy routines stored to user memory with PAN
still set and every copy took a permission fault. SM8250 is ARMv8.2 and
implements PAN, so simply say so.

